  ProjectName: Machine Showcase
  ClientName: Adira
  Tags: 2
  Texts:
  - category: 0
    info: Unity Developer
  - category: 1
    info: 'ADIRA is a global manufacturer of sheet-metal working machinery: laser
      cutters, hydraulic press brakes, shears, robotic bending cells and automated
      sheet-metal systems.'
  - category: 2
    info: 'An interactive VR showcase of the client''s machinery. Animated sequences
      show the machines working, and users can interact with them to learn how the
      production process works.

      

'
  - category: 6
    info: 'The project started on HTC Vive with the SteamVR SDK. Midway through,
      we moved to standalone Oculus Quest 2 and switched to the Oculus plugin.

      

'
  - category: 3
    info: 'The machine models were highly complex, and moving to standalone Quest
      hardware made performance a serious problem.

      

'
  - category: 9
    info: '- Created LOD chains for the heavy machine models.

      - Tuned quality
      settings for the Quest.

      - Together, these brought the experience to
      a consistent frame rate throughout.'
